Generated shop art drops here, 1536x1024 PNG, under the exact filenames
shop.html looks for:

  hero.png
  card-the-cluster.png
  card-the-dynasty.png
  card-the-canopy.png
  card-the-scarlets.png
  card-the-portal.png
  card-the-raptor.png
  difference.png

Each slot falls back to the catalogue photograph in pieces-data.js while a
file is missing, so the page is whole with this folder empty.

Check every generated image against the catalogue before publishing: it
carries the true stone for each work, and a card showing the wrong material
is a product photo that misrepresents what ships.
